     2	# Replication Package for "_A Study on the Pythonic Functional Constructs' Understandability_" to appear at ICSE 2024
     3	
     4	- **Authors**: Cyrine Zid, Fiorella Zampetti, Giuliano Antoniol, Massimiliano Di penta
